# The reception of the protagonist's new drawings (`npm run assets:intake`): what is dropped in art/player/inbox/<clip>/ and the reports it writes are local working files;
# a delivery that is accepted is archived, with its anchors, in art/player/source/delivered/<clip>/ (that one is committed)
/art/player/inbox/*/
